WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Synthetic demonstration: no connected NetSuite system.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Choose a fictional customer and review the context.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Reuse the lines of a fictional order.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Add a product to the cart.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Save the draft in this browser.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Resume the draft after reloading.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
An ambiguity blocks the next step.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Review fictional product references and prices.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Explicitly select the demonstration product.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The cart is recalculated after the human choice.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Review the summary. No server validation.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
A simulated failure preserves the cart lines.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Retry completed. No order was created.
